Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.17,0:00:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  乔伊  菲比  帮我个忙好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey! Hey, Pheebs. Listen, uh Can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忘记提款卡的密码  你可以帮我去找吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I forgot the PIN to my ATM card. Can you get it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  在哪里  我刻在提款机的角落那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Where is it? Uh, I scratched it on the ATM machine on the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来5639是你的密码\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, so you're 5-6-3-9?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  菲比  谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it! Thanks Pheebs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要跟钱德说话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you wanna talk to Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是乔伊吗  让我跟他说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that Joey? Let me talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  他不相信我的电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. He didn't believe in my movie...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.19,0:00:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他大错特错  这次的电影是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...which is a big mistake, because it is real. Real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这星期都试着跟他道歉  若他不让我在电话上说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? I've tried to apologize in all week. If I can't do it on the phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就直接杀过去当面说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll go down there and do it in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我听到了  请他听电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uhh Pheebs, I heard that. Uh, can you put him on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你别过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Don't come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我百分之百支持你  我要当面证明给你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No-no-no-no, I support you 100 percent and I wanna prove that to you in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到  我原谅你  你别过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got that. I forgive you. Don't come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我  你一星期都不接我电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Forgive me? You haven't taken my calls for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:01:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  我早都不介意了  咱们是一辈子的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm totally over it Chandler. Friends forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以跟我们照张相吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you mind doing a picture with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.27,0:01:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《今夜娱乐》节目\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Entertainment Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  很高兴跟你说话  你别过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay so, good talking to you and don't come out here. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第23集  拉斯维加斯之旅（上集）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E23  The One In Vegas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.09,0:01:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.03,0:01:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  抱歉我迟到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica? I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.91,0:02:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.70,0:02:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到很久了吗   没关系啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you been here long? That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么拖了那么久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  不许你跟钱德说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you can't tell Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我遇见了理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That I ran into Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个理查  那个理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which Richard? The Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查西蒙斯  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard Simmons? Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦  是我前男友理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, my ex-boyfriend Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,个子高高  有胡子那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, the tall guy, mustache.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这就说得过去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, that actually makes more sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.31,0:02:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情况如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了  我们先是闲聊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was, it was really nice. We started talking 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来一起吃了个午饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I-I ended up having lunch with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪了  我有梦到你跟理查吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is so weird! I had a dream that you'd have lunch with Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  不过是跟理查西蒙斯啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? But again, Simmons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你继续说  奇怪的是虽然他很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go on. The strange part was he was really nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也很帅  但是我对他完全没感觉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and he looks great, but I didn't feel anything at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么不能跟钱德说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Ooh! So now why can't we tell Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他听了一定会发神经\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because it would totally freak him out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天就是我们的纪念日  我不想搞砸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and tomorrow's our anniversary. I don't wanna spoil that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信你们交往一年了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I can't believe you guys lasted a whole year!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  我欠瑞秋20美元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I owe Rachel 20 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  那是完全不相干的赌局啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? On a totally different bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.69,0:03:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一周年纪念日快到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's almost our anniversary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信吗  一年前的今天  我还是只是烦人的朋友钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you believe it? One year ago today, I was just your annoying friend Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你是我烦人的朋友钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, now you're just my annoying friend Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你买了礼物   纪念日明天才到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh.  I got you a present! Oh, but it's not 'til tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  但你今天就要开礼物  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, but you have to open it today. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay! There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两张去赌城的机票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's two tickets to Vegas! Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.55,0:03:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这周末的来回机票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! For this weekend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定很完美  不但能去看乔伊  还能在飞机上开始过纪念日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh gosh, it would be perfect, we get to see Joey plus we get to start our anniversary celebration on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就叫做 "飞机纪念日"吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can call it our "Plane-a-versary."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要这样叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.07,0:03:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是很棒没错  但乔伊说了不要我们过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay this is great, but Joey said he didn't want any of us out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是怕麻烦我们而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, he just doesn't want us to go through any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想到时候我们突然出现  他一定超兴奋的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Think of how excited he'll be when we go out and surprise him! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们自己还有 "赌城纪念日"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, we get to have our own "Anna-Vegas-ry"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"内华达纪念日"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"A-Nevadaversary!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.33,0:04:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们该开始和别人交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I think we should see other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以去吧   对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好  这是个好主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Okay! Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  我也要去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm gonna go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  这是我俩的纪念日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know Pheebs, it's kind of our anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来  休想再像上次伦敦那样把我甩掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh please, you are not gonna ditch again like you did with London.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  哪有甩掉   当时你怀了三胞胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ditch you?  Phoebe, you were pregnant with the triplets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我不管  我非去不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. Great story. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意  这周末大家一起去赌城  给乔伊一个惊喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys, Listen, this weekend we're all gonna go to Las Vegas to surprise Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包括我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Including me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该可以请个几天假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can take a couple days off work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当然可以请几天假  因为这趟我也要去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course you can take a couple days off, because this trip includes me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  差点忘了  我明天要提报告  不能缺席\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh no, wait a minute, wait, I've got a presentation tomorrow. I can't miss that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也买了梵谷画展的票  我盼了一年才盼到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got tickets to the Van Gogh exhibit. I've been waiting like a year for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  不如你我周六再飞去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Rach，you and I could fly out together Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.14,0:05:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来很可行  好  那我打电话去订票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sounds great. Yeah? All right I'll call the airlines. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实想起来也很不赖  我可以独自在公寓过一晚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, Y'know，that would be nice actually, to have the apartment to myself for a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你可以脱光光到处走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh yeah, so you can walk around naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我可以自己一个人 享受独处的时光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, so I can be by myself. Y'know? Have a little alone time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脱光光的独处时光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Naked alone time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我想一个人独处  并不表示我就想脱光光到处走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! Phoebe Just because I'm alone doesn't mean I wanna walk around naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己一个人住  你也不会脱光光到处走啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You live alone, you don't walk around naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.99,0:05:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我为什么老半天才去开门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. Why does it takes me so long to answer the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这趟旅程到现在为止  比起伦敦那趟好还是坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So far, is this trip to Las Vegas better or worse than the trip to London?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.34,0:05:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  到现在为止都差不多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So far, it's pretty much the same, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  那我给你们糖果之后呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, What about after I give you these candies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我想好一点了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I guess it's a little better now. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  赌城1分  伦敦O分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah-ha! Okay, Las Vegas, 1. London, 0.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞机纪念日快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy Plane-a-versary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aww! I love you!
