Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系啦  别放在心上  等回去再给我就行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh that's okay. Don’t worry about it, you can give it to me when we get back.
