Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  你最后还是决定  要跟钱德说理查的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh good! All right, so you decided to tell him about the Richard thing.
