Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么理查的事   用西蒙斯混过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What "Richard thing"? Simmons. Go with Simmons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.49,0:07:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我昨天遇到了理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I umm, I ran into Richard yesterday.
