Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你会生气  而我不想毁了周年纪念日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I knew you'd get mad and I didn't want to spoil our anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不生气啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Oh yeah! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你遇到理查  一起吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah,so you-you bumped into Richard! You grabbed a bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没啥大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  伦敦1分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, London, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  怎么会这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧我自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh, check me out.
