Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿起一颗柳丁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm picking up an orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我脱光光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,点起蜡烛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}lighting the candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脱光光  要小心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}naked, and carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  瑞秋真的脱光光了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! That's Rachel, naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能看  我在看书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't look at that. I am looking at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  鲜明的色彩  有力的笔触\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, vivid colors, expressive brush strokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非她故意让我看  就另当别论了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless she wants me to be looking at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.99,0:08:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她知道我在家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She knows I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.87,0:08:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她知道我看得到她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She knows I can see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她这是在玩什么把戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What kind of game is she playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许今晚有人寂寞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think maybe someone's lonely tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖勒博士  别胡思乱想   别自讨没趣了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Dr. Geller.Stop it. You're being silly. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是这样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以进去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.64,0:10:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要的话  就进来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah, if you want to.
