Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.47,0:10:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼此彼此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  在一切还没开始之前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Rach, before anything happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有几个原则我想先说清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I wanna lay down a couple of ground rules.
