Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚过后  你是你  我是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I won't go through with this if it'll raise the question of "us."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.33,0:10:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  我希望这一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? I just want this to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是各取所需\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...about what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  什么各取所需\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, um...what is that, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出自于兽欲的性爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The physical act of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你疯了不成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你刚才脱光光  不是在勾引我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh so-so you weren't trying to entice me just now with your nakedness?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你有看到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God. You saw me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你脱光光不是在勾引我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You weren't trying to entice me with your nakedness?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是  你当真以为我想跟你上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Noo!! No! You thought, you actually thought I wanted to have sex with you?
