Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们等等啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等我  这地方比伦敦好多了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys. This place is so much better than London. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个打扮成埃及艳后的女士  给了我这张折价票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This lady dressed like Cleopatra gave me a coupon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用一块美元  就能吃到牛排龙虾晚餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ninety-nine cent steak and lobster dinner. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你又不吃肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, You don't eat animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用一美元  我连你都吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For ninety-nine cents I'd eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全可以耗在这里  我要的东西应有尽有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I can totally settle down here. It's got everything I could ever want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就连乔伊都在  你们看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Including Joey! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点看   天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! Look! Hey! Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey!! Wow! Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的保险套真不赖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Love your condoms, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么会在这里  不是要你们别来了嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What-what are you guys doing here? I thought I told you not to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.37,0:12:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛打扮成神鬼战士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are you dressed as a gladiator?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我正在拍戏  我扮演神鬼战士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, because I'm shooting a scene right now.Yeah, I uh, I play a gladiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.33,0:12:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, y'know what? Hold-hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以卡一下吗  我朋友来了  我要休息一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can we cut? My friends are here. I'm gonna take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在跟谁说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,导演啊  就是她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The director.Uh, her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  我不是在拍神鬼战士  我在这里工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, all right, it's not a gladiator movie. I work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  发生了什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? What happened?
