Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那个男朋友理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Her boyfriend Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那根本不碍事  你怎么到现在还不相信我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It meant nothing. Okay? After all this time, how can you not trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞒着我跟大胡子帅哥吃午餐  要我怎么相信你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you go lunching with hunky moustache men and don't tell me about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对  对不起  我早该跟你说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. I'm sorry. I should've told you.
