Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要你知道  这不是在勾引你一夜情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just letting you know...this is not an invitation to the physical act of love.
